{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も1日お疲れちま(*´˘`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/02/06/8846218/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この度、4月18日(金)～5月6日(火・祝)に公演される、學蘭歌劇『帝一の國』に出演させて頂くことが決定しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈が演じさせて頂くのは、花園高校に通うお嬢様で主人公の彼女、白鳥美美子役です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"井上小百合ちゃんと、Wキャストで務めさせて頂きます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私が舞台に立たせて頂くのは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月19日(土)18:00～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月20日(日)13:00～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4月27日(日)13:00～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月4日(日)13:00～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5月5日(月・祝)13:00～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18:00～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の6公演です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とってもとっても嬉しく思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この機会を与えて下さったスタッフのみなさん、そしていつも応援して下さっているみなさんに、感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きちんと学業と両立し、この舞台に全身全霊を捧げて頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宜しくお願いします！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は早く起きて、朝ごはんを作りました＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1つ上のお姉ちゃんから、少し教えてもらいながら..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"和風スパゲッティとたまごスープ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/02/06/8846218/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族みんな美味しいよって言いながら食べてくれました(*´˘`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しかったなぁ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから、時間があるときはお料理の練習をしていきたいです♬"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてこの間、お仕事の空き時間にゆったんが日奈のお膝にのってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その写真がこちら↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2014/02/06/0002%20%282%29.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お膝の上で、日奈のバックの中をガサゴソしていました。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかねゆったんはすごく面白くて、いつも笑わせてくれるの＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たまにちょっかいだしてくるけど、それがまた可愛くて嫌じゃない(*´艸`)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だからゆったんと付き合うととっても楽しそうだなぁ～♡って思います(*´︶`*)にひひ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2月7日(金)25:58～26:28"},{"type":"break"},{"ty